# /home/desktop/.ssh/authorized_keys on the laptop, owned by root.
# The desktop's job (dietpi-backup-sync.sh, run as root there) logs in as
# `desktop`. Its key can do only what `backup-gate push` allows, and the gate
# accepts it only from the desktop, 192.168.50.20 (dropbear has no from=).
restrict,command="/usr/local/bin/backup-gate push" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...example-public-key... desktop job
